roceeded to do  the entire bag  completely hallucinating he ran outside  his workplace and hid behind a waste bin  [Music]  despite the chaos mcafee's career took  him to lockheed martin in the 1980s a  company that specialized in aerospace  and defense  at the time computers were still  relatively new and it would take a  further six years in 1986 for the first  virus to hit computers  john became curious and read up as much  as he could on pc viruses he decided to  create a company mcafee associates to  fight back against a relatively unknown  problem at the time  i was living with my brother-in-law in  santa clara california and he was  reading the local newspaper about this  thing called  brand new thing computer virus  what is this thing i mean a virus that  could replicate itself live move from  one machine to another well that's  fascinating  um so i sat and i thought about it how  on earth could someone do this and then  it occurred to me how  they did it and at the same time it  occurred to me how i could stop it so i  wrote a little program and  two weeks later five million people were  using it interestingly it was one of the  first pieces of computer software to be  distributed across the internet  by the end of the 1980s his organization  was already making five million dollars  per year and some of the biggest  companies in the world were using his  anti-virus platform  it would not be until 1992 that the  sheer functionality of the software  would be tested against the michelangelo  virus infecting 5 million computers  prior to this antivirus for computers  wasn't seen as a must-have product  however michelangelo changed that  enabling mcafee associates to grow as a  company even further  john would resign from mcafee associates  in 1994 but he was just getting started  two years after this he sold his shares  in the company for about a hundred  million dollars for now he would keep a  low profile but later on in his life he  would be no stranger to the limelight  but more on this later  after conquering the world of anti-virus  jon decided to start a new venture a  venture into social media before social  media was even a thing  it's a little known fact but mcafee  would work on a social network project  mcafee's social media site was to be  called tribal voice and at one point it  had over seven hundred thousand members  it also featured an instant messenger  function called powwow it allowed users  to have a virtual whiteboard play sound  files to each other share files  instantaneously with other users with a  simple drag and drop interface it even  allowed users to share their web surfing  experiences concurrently with others  and all of this was in 1994 a full  decade before myspace would rise to  prominence  unfortunately the project never caught  on to go mainstream perhaps it was too  early  the global financial crisis of 2008  affected john's fortune considerably  apparently his 100 million dollars had  shrunk to as little as four million  dollars  however this would not be the final  chapter in his life story and his  dwindling funds did not deter him from  getting the most out of a search for a  wild life  in the late 2000s mcafee began selling  his land and moved to belize a caribbean  country situated on the northeastern  coast of central america  his lifestyle in belize was certainly  not for everyone it defied conventional  living soon enough pictures of him  started surfacing on the internet with a  haram of women and he often had locals  who he used as personal bodyguards armed  with guns  these shady dealings led to rumors about  him making drugs  there were many insane activities that  john got up to in this time including  excessive drug use and allegedly  fathering 47 children  it was through this bizarre lifestyle  that he managed to retain cultural  significance  though at this stage john's mental  health will start to decline rapidly and  he became increasingly paranoid  during this time in belize mcafee  personally felt that he was losing any  form of connection with society  this hiatus away from american tech  culture saw john get involved in the  world of antibiotics the microbiologist  alison adonizo gave him assistance  towards creating a product using plans  to combat illness  though later on alison would accuse john  mcafee of sexual assault  [Music]  as time progressed john's life would get  even more insane  while in belize john was having  disagreements with his neighbor gregory  fowle the disagreements were over his  dogs  according to the documentary gringo the  dangerous life of john mcafee  foul poisoned mcafee's dogs  although mcafee refutes what was said in  the documentary apparently he had given  five thousand dollars to a local hitman  to torture and kill gregory in 2012.  i barely knew gregory fought i'd never  had dinner with him i'd never spoken the  entire five years i was there i said  maybe 50 words to him  he did not like my dogs and the the past  two occasions i had seen him walking the  beach he he complained but so did  everybody how do you feel knowing that  there's going to be people out there who  are going to always suspect that you did  it that's a public perception that that  i have no control over right now i had  no connection whatsoever with mr fall's  death  if someone wants to think otherwise  that's okay  at the time of his passing the family  members of gregory passed mcafee's name  to the authorities  not long after this occurred john mcafee  was mentioned as a person of interest to  the belize government  in 2012 the media outlet vice was  interviewing mcafee in guatemala after  he had snuck out from belize pictures of  him were published usually not a big  deal but these particular pictures  included gps coordinates  this was enough detail for the  guatemalan police to use in order to  hunt down mcafee he was arrested on  charges of illegal entry into the  country  while under arrest some speculate that  john faked a series of heart attacks  real or not he was sent back to america  in 2013 mcafee posted a youtube video  called how to uninstall mcafee software  the footage is comical in nature mcafee  is acting absurd with a bunch of women  surrounding him there's guns chain  smoking and him snorting drugs all while  talking directly to the viewer the video  has 11 million hits on youtube  in 2015 mcafee was arrested in tennessee  for driving under the influence and  being in possession of a firearm while  intoxicated  mcafee would continue being a public  figure and would constantly talk about  cyber security privacy and freedom all  the while the us government was chasing  to recover millions of dollars that they  said that mcafee owed in taxes  john refused to give the government tax  returns between 2014 to 2018 it was his  belief that taxation was theft  interestingly john mcafee would run for  u.s president both for the 2016 and 2020  elections  why do you want to run for president  because sir  the greatest problem facing america  today is cyber war it is on the horizon  larry already two teenagers took out the  entire country of ukraine's power for  one day using a 25 year old piece of  software with 17 lines of code can you  imagine sir what the chinese can do to  us and you tell me who is running today  who can fix this problem  by now mcafee had been avoiding u.s law  enforcement for some years and some of  that time aboard his mega yacht and then  things began to get really strange as if  they weren't already  a tweet by him in 2019 made the claim  that quote the us government would kill  him and cover it up as a suicide and  another tweet would read quote getting  subtle messages from the u.s officials  saying in effect we're coming for you  mcafee we're going to kill yourself end  quote  john had even got a tattoo which read  whacked which was a reference to his  cryptocurrency and also his firm belief  that jeffrey epstein didn't kill himself  on october 3rd 2020 john was in a  spanish airport he was about to board a  flight to istanbul but he was detained  by authority he was sent to prison and  was due to be extradited back to the us  he would be found dead on june 23 2021  in spanish prison he was 75 years old  [Music]  mcafee's death in a spanish prison cell  was shrouded in mystery it proved to be  a fertile ground for online conspiracy  theories and that's not unexpected  considering his social media posts  janus john's widow reportedly told media  outlets that his last words were  i love you and i will call you in the  evening  i blame the u.s authorities for this  tragedy  because of these politically motivated  charges against him my husband is now  dead  he did not deserve to die in a filthy  prison  like a caged animal the associated press  though did report that he was found with  a suicide note on him  allegedly john had tried to kill himself  before in february in a different part  of the barcelona jail  a psychiatrist made the assessment that  john was just attention-seeking and it  was a stunt but it resulted in him being  moved to another part of the facility  the main reason that people doubt that  john mcafee killed himself was that he  claimed to have a dead man switch and  this would release a number of sensitive  documents  in 2019 mcafee was recorded stating  quote i've collected files on corruption  in governments for the first time i'm  naming names and specifics i'll begin  with a corrupt cia agent and two  bahamian officials coming today if i'm  arrested or disappear 31 plus terabytes  of incriminating data will be released  to the press  even more controversy stands surrounding  john's death when his instagram posted a  mysterious q  some say that q is a reference to q  others speculate that it could be a key  to the code of the dead man switch  a day after his death a twitter user who  had engaged with mcafee released a  website which was titled contingency  plan activated something big is coming  the website is linked to mcafee's  cryptocurrency whacked and has a timer  countdown which ended on the 27th of  july  to date no bombshell information has  been released  some say it was all just a big scam  suicide or not the death of john mcafee  marks the end of one of the most  eccentric tech moguls in history his  legacy and the story surrounding him  will be spoken about for many years to  come  from being a pioneer in distributing  software over the internet and creating  one of the first social media sites in  history to being a wanted man for murder  and tax evasion john's life was  certainly a wild ride  his story is interesting because he was  clearly intelligent and a visionary in  select areas but his character in  history was so wild that you couldn't  trust much of what he said so the  question still remains was mcafee simply  a crazed and troubled man who gave up in  prison or did another party take him out  nobody can know for sure but the comment  section in this one will be very  interesting so thanks for watching my  name is degogo and you've been watching  cold fusion and i'll see you again soon  for the next video  cheers guys  have a good one  [Music]  foreign  [Music]  you

